atinum, Emerald, Diamond, Master, Grandmaster and Legend. The first 10 Iron levels and level 1 of every other world are free. Unlock a world with a one-time purchase, or every world at once with the All Worlds Bundle. No subscriptions.\n\nBUILT AROUND RECALL, NOT LUCK\n\u2022 Three stars for clearing a board in the fewest flips\n\u2022 A mistake allowance and flip budget that scale with the board\n\u2022 Stuck? A reveal credit shows the whole board again. Your first one is free.\n\nQUIETLY RESPECTFUL\n\u2022 No ads, no account, no tracking\n\u2022 Plays offline\n\nPoint and select with your controllers or your hands.", "short_description": "One thousand boards of hand-drawn cards: farm animals, ocean life, dinosaurs, vehicles, deep space. Every level shows you the whole board for a moment, then turns it face down. Find every pair before your tries run out. Ten worlds from Iron to Legend, each with its own twist, and no ads."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://github.com/Meshy-SC/MemoVision/blob/main/PRIVACY_POLICY_MH.md", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Meshy", "support_website_url": "https://github.com/Meshy-SC/MemoVision/blob/main/SUPPORT_MH.md", "website_url": "https://github.com/Meshy-SC/MemoVision", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "377978390272490"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH", "HAND_TRACKING"], "supported_player_modes": ["SITTING", "STANDING"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "2064089984302903"}}]}, "scheduled_o